  "body": "From the moment you step through the gate into the beautifully private courtyard, you know you have discovered something special. This stunning home combines timeless style with modern comfort, offering a wonderful lifestyle in a highly sought after location.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautiful kitchen, complemented by a casual family living and dining area that opens to a private courtyard capturing the morning sun. It's the perfect spot to enjoy your first coffee of the day before the world gets busy.\r\nThe thoughtful design provides a wonderful connection between the casual family area and the spacious main living room that opens to a second, north facing courtyard, beautifully sheltered and completely private. Whether you're entertaining friends around the BBQ, relaxing with a good book or watching the children and pets play safely, this delightful outdoor space is sure to become a favourite.\r\nA bedroom and guest powder room on the ground floor add further convenience and flexibility. Upstairs, the impressive master bedroom enjoys its own ensuite, while two further double bedrooms are complemented by a stunning family bathroom featuring both a bath and separate shower.\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Tucked away in a quiet street, you're conveniently positioned between the vibrant Browns Bay village with its beautiful beach, cafes, restaurants and boutique shopping, and Albany's Westfield shopping centre. Easy motorway access makes commuting to the city a breeze.\r\nFamilies will particularly appreciate having Sherwood School and Northcross Intermediate both in zone and just a few minutes walk away. Imagine saying goodbye to the daily school drop offs and pick ups!\r\nBeautifully presented and ready for its next owners, this is a home where you can simply move in, relax and start enjoying everything it has to offer.\r\nAnd best of all, there's no auction or deadline sale to wait for. Simply come along, fall in love and make your offer.\r\nWho knows, you could be celebrating Christmas in your beautiful new home, surrounded by family and friends!",
